pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 60, 500, 16]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: ALPHA-DESK TERMINAL}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 88, 620, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 34
      color: "$ink"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>看得见的专家团，</p>
        <p>数得清的 Token 轨迹</p>
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 196, 620, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>deepseek-harness × vnpy × ai-hedge-fund 量化投研终端</p>
        <p>多大师信号面板 · 逐步思考与工具调用回放 · 逐 step token 计量</p>
  - elementId: meta-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 258, 420, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 272, 500, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>github.com/JingHao-Leon/dsh-alpha-desk · terminal/</p>
        <p>2026-08-15 · 本内容仅供学习研究，不构成投资建议</p>
  - elementId: shot
    elementType: image
    bounds: [56, 330, 848, 180]
    src: media/terminal-trace.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {top: 0.05, bottom: 0.35}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: shot-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 512, 848, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "终端实拍：自选报价 · 对话 · K线 · 专家团 四区同屏"}
